在 Linux 上启动速度提升 50%\"", "content_rendered": "<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://bun.com/blog/bun-v1.4\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://bun.com/blog/bun-v1.4</a><br /><br />被 Claude 收购后的首个版本，利用 AI 从 Zig 重构到 Rust<br />\"它将空闲 CPU 使用率降低 5 倍，内存使用率降低最多 35%，在 Linux 上启动速度提升 50%\"", "last_modified": 1787414437, "replies": 16, "id": 1236482}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 72894, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9764, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 443643, "username": "Rogeryxx", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Rogeryxx", "website": null, "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "iamyours", "btc": "", "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9ae52f89a79112cc09b7750b435dd147?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9ae52f89a79112cc09b7750b435dd147?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9ae52f89a79112cc09b7750b435dd147?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1569567939, "last_modified": 1787448462, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "rimworld", "last_touched": 1787462413, "title": "你有 token 用量和上下文焦虑吗？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236509", "created": 1787449725, "deleted": 0, "content": "公司给的 200 美金 token 用量都不够用，不到半月就蹬完了。自己买了个第三方 subapi 混着用。gpt-5.6sol 很快就满了，我会经常登陆后台看下用量🤣。\r\n开发时都会看下上下文窗口占用情况，参照写了一个 dsh 用量显示插件，也算缓解自己的用量焦虑了，效果大概下面的样子。\r\n\r\n![演示]( https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamyours/dsh-plugin-model-usage-meter/refs/heads/main/docs/demo.png )\r\n\r\n有需要的自己可以用 dsh 命令添加\r\n```bash\r\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-plugin-model-usage-meter\r\n```", "content_rendered": "<p>公司给的 200 美金 token 用量都不够用，不到半月就蹬完了。自己买了个第三方 subapi 混着用。gpt-5.6sol 很快就满了，我会经常登陆后台看下用量🤣。\n开发时都会看下上下文窗口占用情况，参照写了一个 dsh 用量显示插件，也算缓解自己的用量焦虑了，效果大概下面的样子。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"演示\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamyours/dsh-plugin-model-usage-meter/refs/heads/main/docs/demo.png\"/></p>\n<p>有需要的自己可以用 dsh 命令添加</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-plugin-model-usage-meter\n</code></pre>\n", "last_modified": 1787449725, "replies": 14, "id": 1236509}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 240974, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4509, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 357200, "username": "yfixx", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/yfixx", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6138b0dbd40e3fc92a5321892282dd7a?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6138b0dbd40e3fc92a5321892282dd7a?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6138b0dbd40e3fc92a5321892282dd7a?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1539934775, "last_modified": 1787363967, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "dongdongdong", "last_touched": 1787464494, "title": "你们 vibe coding 的时候更喜欢用 TUI 还是 GUI ?", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236538", "created": 1787460800, "deleted": 0, "content": "你们氛围编程是喜欢用 tui 还是 gui ，或者哪种模式更有优势一些呢？"